9,"series":["al-5420"],"seriesIds":[5420],"startDate":{"day":10,"month":1,"year":2009},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"animation":true,"id":10,"name":"Production I.G"},{"animation":true,"id":80,"name":"Trans Arts"},{"animation":false,"id":317,"name":"NHK Enterprises"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"In the land of Ryoza, the neighboring provinces of Shin-Ou and Tai-Kou have been at peace. Queen Shinou is the ruler of Ryoza and her greatest general, Grand Duke Taikou, defends the kingdom with his army of powerful war-lizards known as the \"Touda.\" Although the two regions have enjoyed a long-standing alliance, mounting tensions threaten to spark a fierce civil war.\n\nWithin Ake, a village in Tai-Kou tasked with raising the Grand Duke's army, lives Erin, a bright girl who spends her days watching the work of her mother Soyon, the village's head Touda doctor. But while under Soyon's care, a disastrous incident befalls the Grand Duke's strongest Touda, and the peace that Erin and her mother had been enjoying vanishes as Soyon is punished severely. In a desperate attempt to save her mother, Erin ends up falling in a river and is swept towards Shin-Ou.\n\nUnable to return home, Erin must learn to lead a new life with completely different people, all while hunting for the truth of both beasts and humanity itself, with tensions between the two regions constantly escalating.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":85,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Animals","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":82,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Veterinarian","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Environmental","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boarding School","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Matriarchy","rank":60,"spoiler":f